  "preparing {count} population masks…": "{count}件の集団マスクを準備中…",
  "Pooling {count} checked FCS…": "チェック済みFCS {count}件を集計中…",
  "Counts pooled across {count} checked FCS": "チェック済みFCS {count}件の集計値",
